 ],
 "type": "Hardware",
 "embodiment": "Multi-Chip Stand Alone",
 "description": "DocuSign HSM Appliance is a high-performance cryptographic service provider. It performs high-speed cryptographic operations while protecting sensitive data. Its features include Triple-DES, AES, Triple-DES MAC, CCM, HMAC, RSA, ECDSA, SHA-1, SHA-256, SHA-384, SHA-512, public key database and certificate support, authenticated and encrypted communication with the module, secure storage of secret/private keys, software key medium and smartcard support, tamper-responsive enclosure, high level API requiring no cryptographic expertise, in-depth logging and auditing, and secure backup capabilities.",
